<p class=NoParagraphStyle style='text-align:justify;text-indent:8.5pt'><span
lang=EN-GB style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>UCVSM: Ulusal Coğrafi
Veri Sorumluluk Matrisi</span></p>

<p class=NoParagraphStyle style='text-align:justify;text-indent:17.0pt'><span
lang=EN-GB style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=NoParagraphStyle style='text-align:justify;text-indent:17.0pt'><span
